id: DRAFT-libpuzzle-0.11-old-config-guess-sub-build-only-fallback
trigger_tool: conan|configure|sh
phase: build
error_signature: cannot guess build type; you must specify one|config\.sub aarch64-linux-ohos failed
severity: 3
category: autotools, build-system, ohos, compat
match_keywords: autotools_configure, configure_failed, config_guess, config_sub
title: 老autotools捆绑陈旧config.guess/sub不识别HarmonyOS与aarch64时仅保留--build的原生构建回退
root_cause: libpuzzle 0.11捆绑2008版config.guess/config.sub不识别HarmonyOS与aarch64，AM_INIT_AUTOMAKE触发build检查调用config.guess猜测失败报cannot guess build type，补--build后--host=aarch64-linux-ohos又被老config.sub校验拒绝
affected_scope: 捆绑老config.guess/config.sub且未打补丁的autotools库在HarmonyOS真机上做build/host规范化时触发
affected_scope: 捆绑老config.guess/config.sub且未打补丁的autotools库在HarmonyOS真机上做build/host规范化时触发
verification_cmd: 真机conan create日志确认checking build system type为x86_64-pc-linux-gnu通过且不再报cannot guess build type与config.sub aarch64-linux-ohos failed，configure进入后续编译检查
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: keep-build-only-native-fallback
rec_description: OHOS手动configure仅保留--build=x86_64-pc-linux-gnu不再传--host，缺省host等于build即原生构建，老脚本仅作占位，真实目标码仍由CC/CXX决定
rec_command: archives/l/libpuzzle/0.11/conanfile.py OHOS分支configure删除--host=aarch64-linux-ohos，仅保留--build=x86_64-pc-linux-gnu并保留shared/static开关
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: update-config-guess-sub-then-restore-host
fallback_description: 若必须恢复交叉三元组语义，先用新版automake的config.guess/config.sub替换捆绑旧脚本并验证可识别HarmonyOS与aarch64后，再恢复--host=aarch64-linux-ohos
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: config\.sub aarch64-linux-ohos failed
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在未替换补丁老config.sub情况下加回--host=aarch64-linux-ohos，老脚本必然校验拒绝
forbid_1_consequence: configure死于host检查Invalid configuration，conan create exit 1退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libpuzzle-0.11-old-config-guess-sub-build-only-fallback.md
last_updated: 2026-09-19
source_event: libpuzzle/0.11真机预检attempt18513加--build通过build检查后attempt18578证伪--host被老config.sub拒绝改仅保留--build
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 11037
